WEBVTT

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.400
(Theseus) I don't
suppose you'd like to

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:16.800
tell me what this is
about, would you?

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:19.760
He just asked that we meet, and
that I be sure to bring you.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:20.880
(Theseus) Hmm.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.000
Right.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:28.080
(patrons chattering)

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:33.120
(mirror squeaking)

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.720
Here to meet my brother, I expect.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.520
No, sir. We're here to
see Albus Dumbledore.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:47.760
-That would be my brother.
-(Newt) Oh.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:50.520
Sorry. I'm, um... Brilliant.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:52.400
I'm Newt Scamander, and
this is Theseus...

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:54.760
Up the stairs. First on the left.

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:05.680
(mirror squeaking)

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:08.400
(Dumbledore) Has Newt
told you why you're here?

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:10.400
Was he meant to?

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:13.240
No. (laughs) As a matter of fact.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:14.160
(Theseus chuckles)

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:17.640
There's something that we, uh...

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:20.560
That, uh, Dumbledore wishes
to speak to you about.

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:22.480
It's a proposal.

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:27.240
All right.

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:31.720
You know what this is, of course.

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:33.120
Newt had it in Paris.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:36.760
I can't say I have much
experience with such things,

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:38.520
but it looks to me
to be a blood troth.

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:41.120
That would be correct.

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:43.800
And whose blood is contained
within?

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:45.760
Mine.

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:47.800
And Grindelwald's.

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:53.320
I'm assuming that's why you
can't move against him?

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:54.200
(Dumbledore) Yes.

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:56.680
Nor he against me.

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:01.080
Can I ask, what would possess
you to make such a thing?

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:03.480
Love.

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:07.680
Arrogance. Naivete. Pick your
poison.

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:11.920
We were young, we were going
to transform the world.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:13.120
(Theseus) Mm.

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:17.080
This ensured that we would, even if
one of us had a change of heart.

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:20.600
And what would happen if
you were to fight him?

00:02:20.680 --> 00:02:21.920
(Dumbledore sighs)

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:33.160
It's really quite beautiful,
you have to admit.

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:39.960
Were I to even think
about defying it...

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:43.240
(pendant humming)

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:45.040
(Theseus gasps softly)

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:53.000
(Dumbledore) It knows, you see.

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:54.200
(grunts)

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:57.360
(straining)

00:02:58.120 --> 00:02:58.960
(Newt) Albus.

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:01.160
It senses the betrayal in my heart.

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:02.520
-Albus. -(Dumbledore whimpers)

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:05.480
(chokes)

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:06.560
(gasping)

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:07.880
Albus.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:09.960
(grunts)

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:11.400
(panting)

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:21.640
(Dumbledore) That would
be the least of it.

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:27.640
(sighs)

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:30.680
Young man's magic, but
as you can see...

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:33.280
powerful magic.

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:38.480
It can't be undone.

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:43.640
(sighs)

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.920
(Theseus) So this
proposal, I take it

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:47.560
the Qilin has something
to do with it?

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:49.240
He promises he won't tell a soul.

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:52.560
(inhales deeply)

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:54.240
If we're to defeat him,

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:56.480
the Qilin's only part of it.

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:00.480
The world as we know
it is coming undone.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:06.200
Gellert's pulling it apart
with hate, bigotry.

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:13.800
Things that seem unimaginable today
will seem inevitable tomorrow...

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:15.880
if we don't stop him.

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:20.040
Should you agree to do what I
ask...

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:22.720
you'll have to trust me.

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:26.040
Even when every instinct
tells you not to.

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:36.840
Let's hear it.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.200
(fly buzzing)

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:47.520
(breathing heavily)

00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:56.120
(quiet footsteps)

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:05.360
Does he send you to spy on me?

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:07.640
No.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.960
But he asks.

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:12.120
What ya thinkin', what ya feeling.

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:14.360
And the others?

00:05:14.440 --> 00:05:16.360
Does he ask what they're
thinking and feeling?

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:19.840
Yes, but it's mostly you.

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:22.120
And do you tell him?

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:24.400
(sighing)

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:26.320
-You do. -(breathes heavily)

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:30.040
Who's reading whose mind now?

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:38.720
Tell me what you see.

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:43.080
(breathing shakily)
You're a Dumbledore.

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:46.840
It's an important family.

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:49.520
You know this because he's told
you.

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:54.400
He's also told you
they abandoned you.

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:58.520
That you were a... A dirty secret.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:03.520
Um... He says Dumbledore
abandoned him too,

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:05.440
and he knows how you feel.

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:08.520
And for that reason...

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:11.080
he's asked you to kill him.

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:16.560
I want you to go now, Queenie.

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:21.920
(Queenie) I don't tell him.

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:25.440
Not always.

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:29.160
Not everything.

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:33.520
(somber music playing)

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:37.680
(soft whooshing)

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:47.520
(sighs)

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:55.880
(mirror squeaks)

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:00.720
(sighs)

